Z||000000||Justin||08-14-2001||10:22 PM||||I am making a 88 Fiero GT for a video game (Need For Speed 4, I am a member of a website that edits games by putting in new cars and tracks and stuff.)  Anyway, I would like all the performance numbers you can give me for a 1988 Fiero GT.  Everything form HP and torque to weight and anyhting else you can come up with.  Here's a screen shot of the Fiero for the game:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://nfspontiac.btwracing.com/downloads/pics/nfs3/88fi.jpg">  <P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>If at first you don't succeed, pretend you were never trying in the first place.<P>visit <A HREF="http://www.twinkiesproject.com" TARGET=_blank>www.twinkiesproject.com</A>  for information on the chemical properties, reactions, gravitational resonse, and density issues of a Twinkie.||||reg||1
