Z||000002||Justin||08-14-2001||10:37 PM||||Yep that's the car.  As you see, it's for NFS 3.  I'm converting it to work on NFS 4.  Some 3d mesh changes, complete performance reworking, and there ya have it.  So what I need is the #'s. Anybody got that?<P>------------------<BR>If at first you don't succeed, pretend you were never trying in the first place.<P>visit <A HREF="http://www.twinkiesproject.com" TARGET=_blank>www.twinkiesproject.com</A>  for information on the chemical properties, reactions, gravitational resonse, and density issues of a Twinkie.||||reg||1
