Z||000008||Justin||08-16-2001||08:40 AM||||well it looks like nobody will get a Fiero for NFS 4.  I cannot contact Eric Arroyo, the original maker of this car.  He now works for EA sports, so if he finds that somebody was illegally reproducing his mesh, he could really get that person in trouble.  I do not want to be that person.  3d meshes are very expensive to buy (usually a couple thousand dollars) so to just steal all his hard work isn't right. If somebody can contact him and get his permission I'll gladly do it though.  I'm still gonna make the car, but just for private use.  And for like the tenth time, does anybody have performance figures on an 88 GT????  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>If at first you don't succeed, pretend you were never trying in the first place.<P>visit <A HREF="http://www.twinkiesproject.com" TARGET=_blank>www.twinkiesproject.com</A>  for information on the chemical properties, reactions, gravitational resonse, and density issues of a Twinkie.||||reg||1
